  "description": "A lightweight MSSQL query helper for .NET applications. Provides parameterized SQL query builders (INSERT, SELECT, UPDATE, DELETE, CREATE TABLE), connection string generators, and a comprehensive quick reference output for SQL Server and ASP.NET development directly in the Visual Studio Output window. Supports .NET Framework 3.5, 4.0, 4.5, 4.6, 4.7, and 4.8. Compatible with all Visual Studio versions from 2010 to 2022.",
